*> Ханойские башни рекурсией: программа HANOI объявлена RECURSIVE, счётчик ходов передаётся по ссылке.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MAIN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-N       PIC 9 VALUE 3.
01 WS-FROM    PIC X VALUE "A".
01 WS-SPARE   PIC X VALUE "B".
01 WS-TO      PIC X VALUE "C".
01 WS-MOVES   PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-OUT     PIC Z(17)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "HANOI" USING WS-N WS-FROM WS-SPARE WS-TO WS-MOVES
    MOVE WS-MOVES TO WS-OUT
    DISPLAY "Total moves: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUT)
    STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM MAIN.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HANOI RECURSIVE.
DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 LS-N1      PIC 9.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-N        PIC 9.
01 L-FROM     PIC X.
01 L-SPARE    PIC X.
01 L-TO       PIC X.
01 L-MOVES    PIC 9(4).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-N L-FROM L-SPARE L-TO L-MOVES.
    IF L-N > 0
        COMPUTE LS-N1 = L-N - 1
        CALL "HANOI" USING LS-N1 L-FROM L-TO L-SPARE L-MOVES
        DISPLAY "Move disk " L-N " from " L-FROM " to " L-TO
        ADD 1 TO L-MOVES
        CALL "HANOI" USING LS-N1 L-SPARE L-FROM L-TO L-MOVES
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM HANOI.
